silver tiara intricately set with sparkling diamonds. Dangling from her ears are dramatic black teardrop-shaped diamond drop earrings, and around her neck is a lavish necklace combining diamonds with black gems in a complex, regal design, completing her queen-like, ultra-luxurious look.\n\nIn one hand, she holds a fanned-out display of playing cards—including high-value cards like the Ace of Hearts and Ace of Spades—near her cheek. In the other hand, she gently cradles a horizontal row of playing cards in front of her; some card faces are slightly blurred due to depth of field, adding visual depth. One card is playfully tucked between her lips, introducing a touch of seduction and allure to the composition.\n\nThe background is dark and softly lit, with faint outlines of the carved golden chair back visible, creating an intimate, noble, and dramatically atmospheric setting. The lighting is soft yet sculpted, highlighting the texture of her skin, the sheen of the silk dress, and the brilliance of her jewelry. The color palette is dominated by black, gold, and red, resulting in a rich, cinematic, and high-fashion aesthetic."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":44,"type":"QwenTE_Unload","pos":[3346.352436547724,138.04007677021167],"size":[226.02390870871605,26],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"任意输入","name":"任意输入","type":"*","link":34}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"任意输出","name":"任意输出","type":"*","links":[49]}],"properties":{"aux_id":"comfyUI-llama-TE.git","ver":"1e221a0f1551d6c15feb8126adc5072d4d9fe98c","Node name for S&R":"QwenTE_Unload"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":60,"type":"easy showAnything","pos":[3342.965231960132,206.95924669199425],"size":[564.1179291939848,789.9350777240504],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"输入任何","localized_name":"输入任何","name":"anything","shape":7,"type":"*","link":49}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"输出","name":"output","type":"*","links":null}],"properties":{"aux_id":"yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use","ver":"337a03bb19273ee084e56b16a59ad35cb07a1a04","Node name for S&R":"easy showAnything","cnr_id":"comfyui-easy-use","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.7"}},"widgets_values":["这张图片展现了一位身着华丽服饰的女性，营造出一种神秘而奢华的氛围。她坐在一张雕花繁复的古典式椅子上，椅背为金色镶边，与深邃的黑色背景形成鲜明对比，凸显了主体的华贵感。\n\n这位女性头戴一顶镶嵌着闪亮水晶或钻石的皇冠，造型精致，仿佛一位女王或扑克牌中的“A”。她身穿一件黑色缎面露肩连衣裙，材质光滑，反射着柔和的光泽，肩部的荷叶边设计增添了一丝柔美与复古气息。她的妆容精致，红唇鲜艳，眼神深邃而富有表现力，直视镜头，充满自信与挑逗感。\n\n她佩戴着多件闪耀的珠宝：一条镶嵌黑色宝石和水晶的颈链，一对垂坠式耳环，以及小巧的耳钉，整体搭配协调且极具视觉冲击力。她的右手举着三张扑克牌（红桃A、黑桃A、方块A），左手则让六张牌呈扇形自然垂落，部分牌面清晰可见，包括梅花K、方块K等，暗示她可能正在进行一场高明的牌局或表演。\n\n整张照片光线运用巧妙，重点照亮了人物的面部、肩部和珠宝，营造出戏剧性的光影效果，增强了画面的立体感和神秘感，整体风格融合了时尚、奇幻与古典元素。"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":56,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[2229.912458930018,148.4966526621142],"size":[471.6175232468031,868.824017861232],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择文件上传","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[50]},{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.18.1","Node name for S&R":"LoadImage","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.7"}},"widgets_values":["8C1395447AA1C531B3868319B7DACFAE.jpg","image"]},{"id":29,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[369.3563824230214,151.10510408869857],"size":[471.6175232468031,868.824017861232],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择文件上传","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[25]},{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.18.1","No